                    Minister Shri Narendra Modi, in the year 2020. Since its inception, Mission Karmayogi team has
                    functioned with dedication towards developing an eco-system which strives to enable lifelong
                    learning for the Civil Servants, who are an important link for citizen-centric delivery of services.
                    The Capacity Building Commission, established on 1st April, 2021, functions at the core of Mission
                    Karmayogi, through policy frameworks laying foundation of capacity building initiatives.
